      'The pyramid c3–d4–e3 is nearly indestructible. Black can rarely break it by force.',
      'Nbd2 (not Nc3!) keeps c3 free for the pawn and supports e4/f3 breaks later.',
      'Trade the dark bishops (Bh4–Bg3–h4 ideas or …Bd6 Bxd6) when ahead in space.',
      'Strike back in the center with e4 or c4 once fully developed — solidity first, then expansion.',
